---
// Simplified Chinese translation of src/pages/manifest.astro. The English page is the
// page of record; `source` is its git blob sha at the revision this translation follows.
//
// The shell is composed here rather than through `Doc.astro` so the page can declare the
// language it is written in while the sidebar stays on the English route it highlights.
import fs from 'node:fs';
import path from 'node:path';
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import SectionNav from '../../components/SectionNav.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import SchemaFields from '../../components/SchemaFields.astro';
import TranslationNote from '../../components/TranslationNote.astro';
import { translationStrings } from '../../data/i18n';
import { localizeSchema, readSchemaSources, schemaMap, schemaMapInputs } from '../../schema-i18n';
import lejiSyntaxTheme from '../../styles/shiki-leji.json';
import { REPO_ROOT, SITE_ROOT } from '../../repo-root';

const source = 'f3e18af84beae4479599b3eb247f7e8ff97cb27c';
const strings = translationStrings('zh-hans');

// Field rows are generated from the schema, so this page can't drift from it. The schema
// file itself is a machine surface and is never translated; what this page shows of it is
// read through the locale's schema map, the same one the translated schema reference
// renders from, so the two pages state the same contract in the same words.
const schemaRaw = fs.readFileSync(path.join(REPO_ROOT, 'schemas', 'context-manifest.schema.json'), 'utf-8');
const schemaMapZhHans = schemaMap('zh-hans', schemaMapInputs(readSchemaSources()));
const schema = localizeSchema(JSON.parse(schemaRaw), schemaMapZhHans['context-manifest'].strings);
// A manifest that exercises every field; verified against the schema above.
const exampleRaw = fs.readFileSync(path.join(SITE_ROOT, 'src', 'data', 'manifest-complete.json'), 'utf-8');
---

<Base
   lang="zh-hans"
   title="清单（leji.json） · Leji"
   description="leji.json 清单：Leji 上下文层的机器入口，声明它的上下文根目录、引导配置、类别索引文件与一致性声明。"
>
   <SiteHeader />
   <div class="wrap">
      <div class="doc-shell">
         <SectionNav current="/manifest/" />
         <main id="content" class="prose">
            <PageHeader kind="reference" />
            <h1>清单：<code>leji.json</code></h1>
            <TranslationNote strings={strings.note} href="/manifest/" />
            <p class="sp-lede">{schema.description}</p>

            <p>清单是 Leji 唯一规定了固定名称的文件，工具始终可以在仓库根目录找到它。</p>
            <p>
               字段表由<a href="/zh-hans/schemas/context-manifest/">该 schema</a
               >生成，因此本页内容始终与契约保持一致。本页涵盖顶层字段和部分嵌套字段；更深层的结构，例如某个 actor
               的角色与命令，请直接阅读 schema。必填字段已作标记。
            </p>

            <h2>字段</h2>
            <SchemaFields schema={schema} />

            <h2>一个完整示例</h2>
            <p>
               下面是一个组织级联邦上下文层的完整示例，其中挂载了一个同级层，使用的字段远多于实际场景通常所需。多数上下文层只需声明自己用到的字段子集：<code
                  >leji init</code
               > 脚手架生成的只是其中少数几个字段，而一个 <code>core</code> 级别的清单要短得多。
            </p>
            <p>
               这个形态里有两点容易读错：每个类别指向的是撰写好的<strong>索引文件</strong>，不是内容目录；而 <code
                  >agents</code
               > 把角色标识符绑定到配置文档，它是角色目录而不是加载顺序，因此绑定某一份配置绝不会导致它被读取。
            </p>
            <p>
               有一个字段是条件式的，而不是声明式的：<code>viewer.theme.link</code>
               只有在相对查看器的行内代码背景达到 4.5:1 的对比度时，才会为正文链接与行内代码着色；未达到该下限的取值会以告警形式报告，同时保留那个固定的无障碍色调。
            </p>
            <div class="manifest-example">
               <Code code={exampleRaw.trimEnd()} lang="json" theme={lejiSyntaxTheme} wrap />
            </div>

            <p>
               清单与索引、变更日志和各类配置之间的关系，见<a href="/zh-hans/spec/machine-readable-surface/"
                  >机器可读接口</a
               >；<code>leji</code> 这个规范版本系列键，见<a href="/zh-hans/spec/versioning/">版本管理</a>。
            </p>
         </main>
      </div>
   </div>
   <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
   .manifest-example :global(.astro-code) {
      background: var(--leji-deep) !important;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
      font-size: var(--code-fz);
      line-height: 1.6;
   }
</style>
